  * debian/patches : cleaned DEP-3 headers (Assisted-By)
  * debian/control : Architecture i386 only (32-bit 4klang), Homepage to
    pouet, longer description
  * debian/copyright, README.Debian, manpage, desktop file : updated
  * debian/*lintian-overrides : pandoc groff-message, no PIE (32-bit
    4klang assembly), upstream Windows binaries

